+	/*
+	 * In the suspend path we use async cancel_work(), to avoid blocking
+	 * on sel_work, which acquires gpu->lock (which could deadlock since
+	 * other paths acquire gpu->lock before perfcntr_lock) or already
+	 * hold gpu->lock.
